        "subject": "LU-20214 tests: skip conf-sanity/104a in interop",
        "message": "LU-20214 tests: skip conf-sanity/104a in interop\n\nDo not run conf-sanity.sh test_104a when running in interop.\nThe old clients will try to use the old 'noacl' mount option,\nbut it is ignored by newer servers and the test fails.\n\nFixes: 2924d62f60 (\"LU-20214 osd-ldiskfs: no support for noacl in 6.0+\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nTest-Parameters: testlist=conf-sanity env=ONLY=\"103 104\",HONOR_EXCEPT=y clientversion=2.17\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I29573bafb70e7b34b236797122be1d5e19c75284\n"
